#N canvas 0 50 700 380 12;
#X text 10 10 go.hold - each number passes at once and is held: when the time (ms) goes by with nothing new \, the resting value goes out - 0 \, or the second argument. go.hold 2000 makes a press of a button last two seconds. A number that is the resting value passes and ends the hold. reset ends it without a word. Right inlet: the time.;
#X obj 10 90 inlet;
#X obj 460 90 inlet;
#X obj 10 120 route reset float;
#X obj 10 150 t f f;
#X obj 60 180 expr \$f1 == \$f2;
#X obj 60 210 sel 1 0;
#X msg 60 240 stop;
#X obj 160 270 delay 100;
#X obj 160 300 f;
#X obj 10 340 outlet;
#X obj 460 120 loadbang;
#X obj 460 150 list append \$1 \$2;
#X obj 460 180 unpack f f;
#X obj 460 210 sel 0;
#X msg 460 240 100;
#X obj 520 240 t f;
